[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"04b5c4a5-829e-45e9-b65c-9339d850fa41","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h1 class=\"align-center\">À PROPOS DE NOUS</h1>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"3c4d825a-250b-4092-b403-820eb8088795","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h2 class=\"align-center\"><br>LACCICO – DES LACETS PAR UN CORDONNIER</h2>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}}},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"6494ba75-2d53-4772-86c4-dfffc48a9991","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"78efacab-aa2d-4ec3-aa30-f27eed55149d","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentymarkets.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Ueber_uns/Annette_und_Alexander_3.png","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentymarkets.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Ueber_uns/Annette_und_Alexander_3.png","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentymarkets.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Ueber_uns/Annette_und_Alexander_3.png","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentymarkets.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Ueber_uns/Annette_und_Alexander_3.png","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":""},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"3d91f9d5-3277-48a2-8688-120e706bf0b2","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h2><strong>Pourquoi nous rendons la simplicité parfaite.</strong></h2>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"26f3aa19-664e-465a-9adb-ba28c2af8670","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>LACCICO est synonyme de qualité, de tradition et de savoir-faire artisanal européen. Le nom associe l'italien <strong>« LACCI »</strong> (lacets) à l'exigence d'une <strong>« CO »</strong> (Company) spécialisée. Selon la phonétique italienne, le nom se prononce <strong>[ˈlatʃiko]</strong>, avec l'accent sur la première syllabe. L'idée est née là où l'artisanat est chez lui : lors de nos voyages communs à travers les ateliers d'Italie.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":1},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"af2b85be-65a3-48c3-b11c-edd49c7e50e1","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3><strong>La vision :</strong></h3><h3><strong>Un pont entre les mondes</strong></h3>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":2},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"3fe4505e-202b-4204-96e8-e548f04ed835","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>Avec ma compagne Annette, artiste et musicienne d'église dotée d'un sens aigu de l'esthétique et du rythme, j'ai remarqué lors de nos voyages un net écart dans la qualité de l'offre. Alors qu'en Italie nous admirions les qualités de lacets cirés haut de gamme sur de belles chaussures, le commerce d'accessoires chez nous ne proposait presque que des produits de masse simples et souvent peu durables.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":3},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"4d792861-f8a0-4229-878f-211b3d79e0e7","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>Inspirés par le soin que les Italiens portent au détail, nous avons décidé de combler ce manque. Nous voulions rendre accessible à tous, comme accessoire fiable et exclusivement par notre vente directe, la qualité exceptionnelle que l'on ne trouve sinon presque que sur les lacets d'origine de belles chaussures italiennes.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":4}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"a5dc8af5-8b74-4e56-bd9c-f396fe0fd186","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"efb3907b-1666-45cf-a37c-f7fa477c80d1","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Splendore/Images/Startseite/Logo_small_2400.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Splendore/Images/Startseite/Logo_small_2400.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Splendore/Images/Startseite/Logo_small_2400.jpg","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Splendore/Images/Startseite/Logo_small_2400.jpg","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/fr/chaussures-professionnelles-et-elegantes"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"53e6f85f-8f44-443e-99aa-b937bd3f0dec","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"724","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}},"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"247fe8bf-c913-40df-8841-314186704935","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"034e9f52-abe9-42d8-812c-949da4a74325","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"738","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"26de8a63-576b-44ba-b875-8e9801b11be3","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Footer/Siegel/Footwear_Maker_Guild_Siegel_Transparent_2.png","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Footer/Siegel/Footwear_Maker_Guild_Siegel_Transparent_2.png","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Footer/Siegel/Footwear_Maker_Guild_Siegel_Transparent_2.png","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Footer/Siegel/Footwear_Maker_Guild_Siegel_Transparent_2.png","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/fr/laccicolacetsfinscires/info"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}},"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"6ad469df-f81c-4ac4-bd26-8328b1ba0488","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"16e11383-4126-484d-ac75-c4c1b2203c77","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3><strong>Le maître cordonnier :</strong></h3><h3><strong>Une expertise depuis 1986</strong></h3>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"8edf27d2-776a-4fca-9d6c-a21c5a6996bc","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p><br>Cordonnier de formation, titulaire du titre de maître (obtenu en 1995), je ne considère pas les chaussures comme un objet de mode, mais comme une construction. Depuis la fin des années 1980, j'ai appris à bien connaître des dizaines d'ateliers, de tanneries et de fournisseurs en Europe. Je sais comment le cuir travaille et comment la pression doit se répartir dans la chaussure.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":1},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"1dd48566-03a8-46d2-9717-794a0d062fb7","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p><br></p><p>Ce savoir entre dans chaque choix de nos produits. Chez LACCICO, pas de compromis : je contrôle personnellement chaque lot, avec l'œil exercé du maître et la main de l'artisan qui sait ce qui compte.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":2},{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"dabe2607-5245-40dc-a4bf-a7338574e7e5","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"729","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}},"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"3daf4224-5072-4f1c-8662-c90dccd65f44","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"ddcd569e-a58c-417c-8943-7a0308350497","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"category","categoryId":"749","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}},"parent_slot":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"05e25dc0-4b22-406d-948e-b3f958fae2da","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3><strong>La sélection :</strong></h3><h3><strong>Une alliance européenne de la qualité</strong></h3>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"4301f29e-9e82-460d-b4d9-0b26c648a77d","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>Nous faisons fabriquer là où vit la tradition du tressage. Dans une <strong>« Trecchificio »</strong> (tresserie) de longue tradition en Toscane et chez un partenaire spécialisé en Pologne, nos lacets sont fabriqués à partir de fils de qualité.</p><p>Il s'agit de la <strong>qualité OEM (Original Equipment Manufacturer)</strong>, telle que la choisissent des marques de chaussures italiennes renommées pour leur équipement d'origine. Seule une petite partie de cette marchandise exclusive arrive sur le marché libre : nous rendons cette qualité accessible pour vous.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":1,"slot_index":1}]},{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"378a5cba-e072-4a62-aca0-f7d7ce32d4b2","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Lacings/Rechts/Duenn/rechts_0000s_0013_0482C_75_Dunkelblau.jpg_Kopie.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Lacings/Rechts/Duenn/rechts_0000s_0013_0482C_75_Dunkelblau.jpg_Kopie.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Lacings/Rechts/Duenn/rechts_0000s_0013_0482C_75_Dunkelblau.jpg_Kopie.jpg","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Lacings/Rechts/Duenn/rechts_0000s_0013_0482C_75_Dunkelblau.jpg_Kopie.jpg","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/fr/forme-et-diametre/lacets-ronds-classes-par-diametre/lacets-ronds-de-2-mm/r2-cs_286_1381"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}}},{"name":"MultiGrid","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"f8625986-f8e0-4b28-9571-a521bb383431","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"columnWidths":[6,6],"layout":{"gap":"L","marginTop":0,"marginBottom":0,"backgroundColor":"transparent"},"visible":true},"content":[{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"bf2f23bf-cdc5-49f5-9dfd-72fa217a1ae0","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h3><strong>Notre philosophie :</strong></h3><h3><strong>Le détail fait la différence</strong></h3>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":0},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"3621453a-7fcf-496b-a4a9-f34f78705928","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<p>Un lacet LACCICO est un accessoire réfléchi. Il doit être résistant à la déchirure tout en restant souple. Il doit briller tout en offrant une bonne prise en main. Grâce à notre cirage spécial et à la construction dense du tressage, nous proposons un produit qui vieillit comme une bonne chaussure : avec caractère et dignité.</p><p>Nous vous invitons à sentir la différence. Car la perfection commence là où les autres cessent de regarder : au lacet.</p>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}},"parent_slot":0,"slot_index":1},{"name":"Carousel","type":"structure","meta":{"uuid":"c928d435-688b-4996-81d4-25c971d4d4af","isGlobalTemplate":false},"configuration":{"controls":{"color":"#000000","displayArrows":true},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}},"content":[{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"4b576359-896a-463d-8160-a6b68c2f375f","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Splendore_di_Laccico/R2/0482CC_0019_Grigio-Medio.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Splendore_di_Laccico/R2/0482CC_0019_Grigio-Medio.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Splendore_di_Laccico/R2/0482CC_0019_Grigio-Medio.jpg","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Images/Kategorie/Splendore_di_Laccico/R2/0482CC_0019_Grigio-Medio.jpg","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/fr/"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}}},{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"95b172f5-d9b8-4ebf-ac75-86d0737c7ede","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0034_Lilla.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0034_Lilla.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0034_Lilla.jpg","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0034_Lilla.jpg","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/fr/"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}}},{"name":"Image","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"f0d36729-fcf2-4992-918a-0bf329f02f1d","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"image":{"wideScreen":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0027_Bordo.jpg","desktop":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0027_Bordo.jpg","tablet":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0027_Bordo.jpg","mobile":"https://cdn02.plentyone.com/qadol2fdwt1n/frontend/Artikelbilder/Rundsenkel/0482CC/0482CC_0027_Bordo.jpg","alt":"","imageAlignment":"left","fillMode":"fit","aspectRatio":"auto","linktarget":"/fr/"},"text":{"textOverlay":"","textOverlayColor":"#ffffff","textOverlayAlignY":"bottom","textOverlayAlignX":"left"},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false}}}],"parent_slot":1}]},{"name":"ProductRecommendedProducts","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"f5ae88c2-31cd-434b-9068-44f186e93425","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left"},"layout":{"fullWidth":false},"source":{"type":"last_seen","categoryId":"731","itemId":"","crossSellingRelation":"Similar"}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"0bdb1e6d-5999-46ce-bd80-b4ca8370e23b","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"DÉCOUVRIR LA GAMME","link":"/fr/lacets","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}}},{"name":"TextCard","type":"content","meta":{"uuid":"2d6717c6-bbfa-4a7c-b527-4d718e553d53","isGlobalTemplate":false},"content":{"text":{"htmlDescription":"<h4><em>Ciao Ciao,</em> <em>Annette &amp; Alexander</em></h4>","textAlignment":"left","color":""},"button":{"label":"","link":"","variant":"primary"},"layout":{"backgroundColor":"","paddingTop":0,"paddingBottom":0,"paddingLeft":0,"paddingRight":0}}}]